  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Activity under preparation EU-Caribbean Cooperation Facility Strategic Communication</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Contract related to: EU-Caribbean Cooperation Facility Strategic Communication - The action will support the implementation of strategic communication activities designed to raise awareness, understanding and perception of the European Union and its partnership within the Caribbean Region, in line with the identified priorities in the Americas and the Caribbean Regional Multiannual Indicative Programme as well as relevant global and regional strategies, in particular Global Gateway. This Action will align with the new integrated approach to communication in EU&#xbf;s external actions, moving away from a project-based communication to a thematic-based, campaign-driven strategy that will reduce fragmentation of messages and support stronger narratives to raise awareness among the public on the EU and its impact in the Caribbean region.The Overall Objective of this action is to position the EU as a partner of reference for the Caribbean Region among selected audiences. The Specific Objective (Outcome) is to measurably increase awareness, understanding and support for the EU priorities, in particular those under the Global Gateway strategy, and for the values that underpin the EU&#xbf;s external actions .The Outputs to be delivered by this action contributing to the corresponding Specific Objectives (Outcomes): political communication activities and large-scale public campaigns are implemented to make the EU&#xbf;s brand positioning more understandable, visible and influential to target audiences.The programme will be implemented through direct management using procurement contracts.</narrative>
  </description>
